; regression test for `load`'s relative-path resolution, the `../` direction (companion to
; ../uses-subdir.kurt): a file can `load` a file in its *parent* directory. Resolved the same
; way -- against this file's own directory (`.../load-relative/sub/`) -- so `../helper.kurt`
; must correctly step up to `.../load-relative/helper.kurt`.
load ../helper.kurt
use Q
Q
